# Croatian "last/previous" determiner, the full adjectival paradigm.  Croatian
# names a past year with the adverbial genitive "prošle godine" and a past week
# with either the accusative "prošli tjedan" or the genitive "prošlog tjedna",
# so the nominative-only listing missed the commonest phrasings.  The masculine
# genitive/dative have the attested short and long variants (-og / -oga,
# -om / -ome).  Institut za hrvatski jezik, *Hrvatski pravopis* / Hrvatski
# jezični portal, sklonidba pridjeva.
# https://hjp.znanje.hr/index.php?show=search_by_id&id=eldnUBQ%3D
prošli
prošlog
prošloga
prošlom
prošlome
prošlim
prošla
prošle
prošloj
prošlu
